## Notes
- Config.transport: in-process | http | auto (default auto).
- auto: in-process iff sessionController+workspaceController exist AND webUrl host:port equals this process webServer listen.
- in-process missing controllers fails loud (no HTTP loopback).
- CLI-shaped auto (controllers present, webUrl not this listen) fetches.
- Official default webUrl 3080 + same-process web 3080 is in-process.
